<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Dillon starts Raytel.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Dillon starts Raytel.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Dillon, Read said analysts James Lane and Shahreen Islam initiated coverage of Raytel Medical Corp with a buy rating and a 12-to-18-month price target of $19.</p>
<p>-- The stock was up 1/2 at 12-1/2.</p>
</text>
